    "sentence_translations": [
      "(3) The Apple Phone",
      "",
      "Daxing is in his third year of senior high. At 8 o’clock in the morning, he goes to school, and at 8 o’clock at night, he comes home.",
      "On Saturday and Sunday, he also has to study.",
      "He is very tired, but he must study because he wants to go to a good university.",
      "",
      "Today is Saturday. Daxing is at home studying. Is Daxing happy today? I want Daxing to be happy.",
      "",
      "I looked at my good friend. His name is Apple. He is Daxing’s mom’s cell phone.",
      "Apple hasn’t been too well this week. His body has been very hot.",
      "",
      "I said, “Apple, how’s your body?”",
      "",
      "Apple said, “I’m not too well. My body is a little hot.”",
      "",
      "I asked Apple, “When your owner isn’t happy, what do you do?”",
      "",
      "Apple thought about it and said, “Daxing’s mom likes buying things. We look at Taobao together.”",
      "",
      "Daxing’s mom likes buying things. What about Daxing? What does Daxing like?"
    ]
